{
  "version": 1,
  "comment": "Every profile id the host launches (ImpactoRequest.PROFILES must equal this list). The host APK ships this file as the asset tyn/profiles.json; the Tyranor Next app reads the detection rules from the installed host, so a new profile is recognised without an app update. source: upstream = defined by pinned upstream impacto; tyn-patch = defined by engine/impacto/patches. detect.allOf: entries that must all exist relative to the game folder, exact case (upstream opens them case-sensitively on Android), at most one directory level; detect.textArchive: the text archive that picks a language variant (also required) (variantOf groups the variants of one data set). language: text language of the profile (BCP 47, null = not a language variant). unsupportedLayouts: folder layouts that look like a MAGES. game but match no profile (case-insensitive, same path rules); the app lists such a folder as an unsupported MAGES. game and lets the user try it with tryProfile.",
